  "term": "hydrotherapy",
  "definition": "Hydrotherapy is a treatment approach used for children with cerebral palsy and other neuromotor disorders. Research described in the packet supports benefits for children with cerebral palsy, although its effects may vary across follow-up periods and when compared with other physical therapy methods.",
